# The overlay tree: directories of new engine files, kept here at their engine path and copied into
# the engine tree as they are (atlas/tools/atlas-series install-tree). One engine-relative directory
# per line; its last component starts with "atlas". Overlay patches only hook these files into
# engine files; they never patch them. Owners: atlas/README.md, "Numbering and owners".
chrome/app/atlas
chrome/browser/ui/atlas
components/atlas_host
components/atlas_pages
